      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，我们需要计算一个质量为5千克的铁质零件温度",
        "升高$600^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$时所吸收的热量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "铁的比热是$460\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{千克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}$，这表明，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "要使1千克的铁温度升高$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$所需的热量为460焦耳；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "要使5千克的铁温度升高$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$就需5倍的热量，即需460",
        "焦耳$\\times5=2300$焦耳；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "而要使5千克的铁温度升高$600^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，则所需的热量又要",
        "增大到600倍，即需2300焦耳$\\times600=1380000$焦耳的热量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可见，**要计算使物体温度升高所需要的热量，只需将比**",
        "**热乘以该物体的质量以及该物体在终了时和开始时的温度**",
        "**之差.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这一规律可以用公式表示. 引用符号：$Q$——热量，$c$",
        "——物质的比热，$m$——物体的质量，$t_1$——物体的初温度，",
        "$t_2$——物体的末温度，则有"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q=cm(t_2-t_1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**例题1.** 10千克质量的铁锅中装有20千克的水. 当把",
        "锅及其中的水的温度从$10^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$提高到$100^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$时，需传递给锅多",
        "少热量？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "锅和水二者是同时被加热的. 在它们之间发生着热交",
        "换，所以可以认为它们的温度总是相同的. 于是，不论是锅还",
        "是水，温度都升高了相同的度数：$100^\\circ\\mathrm{C}-10^\\circ\\mathrm{C}=90^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 但是",
        "它们所得到的热量却并不相同，因为它们的质量和比热都是",
        "不相同的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "锅所得到的热量为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
